{"seq":77,"slug":"data-lakehouse-architecture","title":"数据湖与湖仓架构","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 数据湖与湖仓架构\n\n过去十几年，企业存数据的方式经历了一次安静却彻底的革命。数仓曾是唯一选择：贵、封闭、僵硬，但稳。数据湖带着\"先存下来再说\"的承诺登场，用廉价的对象存储解放了成本和灵活性，却常常因为缺少组织而退化成谁也不敢信的\"数据沼泽\"。直到开放表格式出现，在裸文件之上补回了事务、版本和 schema，数据湖才真正升级成既便宜灵活又强一致可治理的\"湖仓\"。到 2026 年，开放湖仓已经成为企业数据平台的默认架构。\n\n这个 hub 用四章带你从地基走到屋顶，层层递进。\n\n第一章「基础」打地基：讲清数据湖是什么、它如何从 Hadoop 时代迁移到对象存储、数仓/数据湖/湖仓三者的本质差异，以及支撑这一切的存算分离思想。读完你会明白湖仓为什么这样长。\n\n第二章「表格式」是全 hub 的技术核心：开放表格式如何用一个元数据层给对象存储的裸文件赋予 ACID、schema 演进和时间旅行。我们会概览表格式的通用结构，深挖 Iceberg、Delta Lake、Hudi 三家的差异与选型，再把模式演进与 ACID 的机制讲透。\n\n第三章「引擎与查询」讲怎么把数据高效地读出来：Trino、Spark、DuckDB 三类引擎如何分工读同一份数据，目录如何成为治理与凭证分发的控制平面，以及 Parquet/ORC 列式文件格式为什么能让分析查询又快又省。\n\n第四章「工程实践」把前三章拼成能落地的系统：数据如何靠 CDC 近实时摄取进来，如何用治理与质量守住可信底线，以及如何用 Medallion 架构的 bronze/silver/gold 三层把数据逐级提纯。最后一篇会把全 hub 的技术串成一条完整链路。\n\n四章之间是一条清晰的主线：地基（基础）→ 核心抽象（表格式）→ 读取能力（引擎）→ 落地范式（实践）。每一篇都用相对链接指向相关的其它篇，构成一张互联的知识网，而不是孤立的条目。建议按顺序读，但每章也可单独查阅。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-lake-concepts","title":"数据湖概念与演进","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/foundations/data-lake-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"warehouse-lake-lakehouse","title":"数仓、数据湖与湖仓对比","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/foundations/warehouse-lake-lakehouse"},{"seq":3,"slug":"storage-compute-separation","title":"存算分离","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/foundations/storage-compute-separation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"table-formats","title":"表格式","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/table-formats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"open-table-formats","title":"开放表格式概览","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/table-formats/open-table-formats"},{"seq":2,"slug":"iceberg-delta-hudi","title":"Iceberg、Delta Lake 与 Hudi","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/table-formats/iceberg-delta-hudi"},{"seq":3,"slug":"schema-evolution-acid","title":"模式演进与 ACID","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/table-formats/schema-evolution-acid"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"engines","title":"引擎与查询","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/engines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"query-engines","title":"查询引擎：Trino、Spark 与 DuckDB","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/engines/query-engines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"metadata-catalogs","title":"元数据与目录","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/engines/metadata-catalogs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"file-formats-parquet","title":"文件格式：Parquet 与 ORC","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/engines/file-formats-parquet"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practices","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/practices","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ingestion-cdc","title":"摄取与 CDC","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/practices/ingestion-cdc"},{"seq":2,"slug":"governance-quality","title":"治理与数据质量","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/practices/governance-quality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lakehouse-patterns","title":"湖仓架构模式：Medallion","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/practices/lakehouse-patterns"}]}]}